x=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink\">Service</h3><p class=\"text-[0.86rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">We put user needs first in everything we design.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:270ms\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-rule bg-paper p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald/30 hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-4 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald/8 text-emerald transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-emerald group-hover:text-paper-fixed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-7 w-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink\">Openness</h3><p class=\"text-[0.86rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Open to developers via API and open-source libraries.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container-x py-14\"><div class=\"reveal\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-emerald/15 bg-paper p-10 text-center lg:p-16\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-8 top-6 opacity-[0.05]\"><span class=\"font-naskh text-[7rem] leading-none text-emerald\">۞</span></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Vision</span><p class=\"mt-5 text-[1.2rem] leading-[2.2] text-ink\">To be the leading Islamic platform, in Arabic and internationally, in spreading beneficial knowledge through refined user experience and trusted content.</p></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></